                "frametrail:name": "A robe turns transparent",
                "frametrail:attributes": {
                    "text": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #f2c66d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFRARED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A robe turns transparent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;The red robe of the kneeling king almost disappears in infrared, and the drawing beneath it shows. The fur collar, painted with black, stays dark.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #b9c0c9;&quot;&gt;Move the lens, then press play to go on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
