                "value": "",
                "frametrail:name": "Bright patches with sharp edges",
                "frametrail:attributes": {
                    "text": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #f2c66d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;X-RAY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bright patches with sharp edges&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;In the man&amp;#x27;s green robe the X-ray shows bright patches with sharp, irregular edges that the painting does not show. They are probably old repairs: the materials used to fill losses often stop X-rays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #b9c0c9;&quot;&gt;Move the lens, then press play to go on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
