                "frametrail:name": "A dog made of lead white",
                "frametrail:attributes": {
                    "text": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #f2c66d;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;X-RAY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A dog made of lead white&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;The little dog is painted almost entirely in lead white. In the X-ray it glows, while the ground it sits on is hardly there.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #b9c0c9;&quot;&gt;Move the lens, then press play to go on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
